{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本福岡縣飯塚市一座歷史宅邸近日舉行Cosplay活動，超過30名來自縣內外的動漫及遊戲角色扮演愛好者，上周六齊集這座位於西南部的前伊藤傳右衛門故居，並在宅邸內拍照留念。伊藤傳右衛門被稱為筑豐地區的煤礦之王，該宅邸是中央政府指定的重要文化財產。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"20260915 JP.COSPLAY\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Pv0qBwsYFX1789375976.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20260915 JP.COSPLAY\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>市政府辦活動　盼年輕人親近文化遺產</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本NHK報道指，市政府舉辦是次活動，希望讓年輕人更熟悉這座歷史宅邸。參與者獲特別准許進入宅邸內的客廳，攝影師為坐在特設椅子上的Cosplayer拍照。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"20260915 JP.COSPLAY\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026zCAkssjmSk1789375996.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20260915 JP.COSPLAY\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>參與者稱難得在宏偉場所拍攝</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名Cosplayer對活動表示非常滿意，她說自己很少獲准在如此宏偉的地方進行拍攝。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"20260915 JP.COSPLAY\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026cpH4txFDbQ1789376020.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20260915 JP.COSPLAY\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T01:49:53.354748+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}